+<body>
+  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>
+  <main id="main" class="page">
+    <header class="page-header">
+      <p class="eyebrow">Knowledge check</p>
+      <h1>Computer Languages Quiz</h1>
+      <p class="lede">Three quick questions about programming languages. Each question may have more than one correct answer — pick all that apply.</p>
